title: "[Beslisboom] RequestProcessorPattern.Rewrite" {shape: text; near: top-center; style: {font-size: 24; bold: true}}
direction: down
q1: "Pre en post tegelijk,\nabstract of static?" {shape: diamond}
q2: "Process in deze klasse,\nniet expliciet?" {shape: diamond}
q3: "Task met Task.CompletedTask\nof async?" {shape: diamond}
q4: "Soort processor?" {shape: diamond}
q5: "TResponse vrij en geen ander gebruik\ndan AddOpenRequestPreProcessor?" {shape: diamond}
q6: "Request is IRequest<T>\nof IRequest?" {shape: diamond}
q7: "Al een basisklasse?" {shape: diamond}
m1: "Manual: abstract or both\n(geen proof)"
m2: "Manual: not declared here / explicit\n(geen proof)"
m3: "Manual: not Task.CompletedTask or async\n(other-return)"
m4: "Manual: TResponse taken or used outside AddMediatR\n(used-elsewhere)"
m5: "Manual: response type unknown\n(geen proof)"
m6: "Manual: already has a base class\n(geen proof)"
f: "MessagePreProcessor / MessagePostProcessor + ValueTask Handle\n(pre-open, post-open-async, pre-closed)"
q1 -> m1: ja
q1 -> q2: nee
q2 -> m2: nee
q2 -> q3: ja
q3 -> m3: nee
q3 -> q4: ja
q4 -> q7: post
q4 -> q5: "open pre"
q4 -> q6: "gesloten pre"
q5 -> m4: nee
q5 -> q7: ja
q6 -> m5: nee
q6 -> q7: ja
q7 -> m6: ja
q7 -> f: nee
